 "differences": [
  "The paper reports 3 h 42 min 3 s of valid data (13323 s), 88 min 19 s of FoG (5299 s) and 334 FoG events; the 56 task files hold 12422 s (3 h 27 min), 5316 s of FoG and 324 episodes (episodes counted as runs of label 1), so those totals are not used as checks. Per patient, the supplement's Table 1 counts agree for patients 01, 02, 04, 05, 06, 08 (second experiment), 10 and 12 (used as checks) but not for 03 (51 runs against 42), 07 (30 against 33), 08 first experiment (23 against 25), 09 (38 against 39) and 11 (51 against 55); the cause is not known. The deposit has additional task 5 and 6 files for patients 04, 08 (first experiment) and 09 that the paper does not describe; they are kept."
